sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note over C, S: [HTTP/2] TCP + TLS 1.3 (2-RTT Handshake)
        C->>S: 1. TCP SYN
        S-->>C: 2. TCP SYN-ACK
        C->>S: 3. TLS Client Hello
        S-->>C: 4. TLS Server Hello + Finished
        C->>S: 5. HTTP GET /data
        S-->>C: 6. HTTP 200 OK (Payload)
    end

    rect rgb(220, 240, 220)
        Note over C, S: [HTTP/3] QUIC (1-RTT Handshake)
        C->>S: 1. QUIC Initial (Transport + TLS Hello)
        S-->>C: 2. QUIC Handshake Done + TLS Finished
        C->>S: 3. HTTP/3 GET /data
        S-->>C: 4. HTTP/3 200 OK (Payload)
    end